{
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/pathosArchives/drDacierScene_DEMO.yarn-drDacierScene_DEMO-7634": "AGATA: 你是这里的负责人？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/pathosArchives/drDacierScene_DEMO.yarn-drDacierScene_DEMO-7635": "DACIER: 是……请问各位是？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/pathosArchives/drDacierScene_DEMO.yarn-drDacierScene_DEMO-7636": "AGATA: 我是守护者团的阿伽塔，来找一本《重写之书》。这是介绍信。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/pathosArchives/drDacierScene_DEMO.yarn-drDacierScene_DEMO-7637": "DACIER: 介绍信……倒是个老派的做法，能问问是谁写的吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/pathosArchives/drDacierScene_DEMO.yarn-drDacierScene_DEMO-7638": "AGATA: 懂堤刻语的话，一看便知。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/pathosArchives/drDacierScene_DEMO.yarn-drDacierScene_DEMO-7639": "DACIER: 堤刻语？不算擅长，不过我看看。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/pathosArchives/drDacierScene_DEMO.yarn-drDacierScene_DEMO-7640": "DACIER: 凯劳诺斯请求……务必深入……亲自查阅《重写之书》……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/pathosArchives/drDacierScene_DEMO.yarn-drDacierScene_DEMO-7641": "DACIER: 不得不说，这伪造得很精巧，写信的人相当熟悉凯劳诺斯的笔迹。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/pathosArchives/drDacierScene_DEMO.yarn-drDacierScene_DEMO-7642": "DACIER: 可他要是还活着，已经快一百五十岁了，所以我不认为——",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/pathosArchives/drDacierScene_DEMO.yarn-drDacierScene_DEMO-7643": "AGATA: 给她看看。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/pathosArchives/drDacierScene_DEMO.yarn-drDacierScene_DEMO-7644": "BEN: 哦，现在我就有价值了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/pathosArchives/drDacierScene_DEMO.yarn-drDacierScene_DEMO-7645": "DACIER: 你……他不会就是凯劳诺斯吧？这也太不注意保养了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/pathosArchives/drDacierScene_DEMO.yarn-drDacierScene_DEMO-7646": "AGATA: 不是，不过他也是法师。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/pathosArchives/drDacierScene_DEMO.yarn-drDacierScene_DEMO-7647": "DACIER: 我……真是震惊得有些站不稳了。我去过下面，见过古代魔法的残留，可从没想过，活人竟也还能施法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/pathosArchives/drDacierScene_DEMO.yarn-drDacierScene_DEMO-7648": "AGATA: 这栋建筑里还有魔法？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/pathosArchives/drDacierScene_DEMO.yarn-drDacierScene_DEMO-7649": "DACIER: 某种意义上是，有些……力量挡着，我们一直没能深入到地下第四层以下。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/pathosArchives/drDacierScene_DEMO.yarn-drDacierScene_DEMO-7650": "DACIER: 最近又塌了一处，能去的地方更少了，不过也许你们能打开通路。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/pathosArchives/drDacierScene_DEMO.yarn-drDacierScene_DEMO-7651": "DACIER: 我真不知道该相信什么了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/pathosArchives/drDacierScene_DEMO.yarn-drDacierScene_DEMO-7652": "AGATA: 我们得下去，越快越好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/pathosArchives/drDacierScene_DEMO.yarn-drDacierScene_DEMO-7653": "DACIER: 我会告诉其他人放行，如果古代记载无误，《重写之书》应该还在最底层的房间。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/pathosArchives/drDacierScene_DEMO.yarn-drDacierScene_DEMO-7654": "DACIER: 见到它就一定认得出来，不过一百多年没人下到那么深了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/pathosArchives/drDacierScene_DEMO.yarn-drDacierScene_DEMO-7655": "DACIER: 如果古代记载无误，《重写之书》应该还在最底层的房间。几百年都没人下到那里了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-firstBarbarianScene_DEMO-7656": "CORDELIA: 这条路比下来时走的近多了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-firstBarbarianScene_DEMO-7657": "AGATA: 等等，有点不对劲。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-firstBarbarianScene_DEMO-7658": "CORDELIA: 有你们的风系法师，应该就能——",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-firstBarbarianScene_DEMO-7659": "BARBARIAN: 老大说对了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-firstBarbarianScene_DEMO-7660": "BARBARIAN 2: 可他说只有四个人……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-firstBarbarianScene_DEMO-7661": "CORDELIA: 多谢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-firstBarbarianScene_DEMO-7662": "BEN: 那些家伙是谁？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-firstBarbarianScene_DEMO-7663": "NIKOLAI: 反正不是朋友。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-firstBarbarianScene_DEMO-7664": "NIKOLAI: 都听一下。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-firstBarbarianScene_DEMO-7665": "NIKOLAI: 通常人多一起作战，就把军官放在后排，安全地汲取魔力……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-firstBarbarianScene_DEMO-7666": "NIKOLAI: ……士兵则在前面打。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-firstBarbarianScene_DEMO-7667": "NIKOLAI: 可现在的问题是，我们这一队，基本个个都算军官。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-firstBarbarianScene_DEMO-7668": "JEROME: 本事再大，施法也很耗精力。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-firstBarbarianScene_DEMO-7669": "NIKOLAI: 没错……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-firstBarbarianScene_DEMO-7670": "NIKOLAI: 要不，一半人在后面休息？是有点奇怪，不过应该可行。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-secondBarbarianScene_DEMO-7671": "BEN: 能不能先……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-secondBarbarianScene_DEMO-7672": "BEN: 就是，我得……呼……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-secondBarbarianScene_DEMO-7673": "BEN: 让我……缓一下……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-secondBarbarianScene_DEMO-7674": "BEN: 喘不过气了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-secondBarbarianScene_DEMO-7675": "CORDELIA: 你……真的没事？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-secondBarbarianScene_DEMO-7676": "BEN: 没事，就是……楼梯爬多了，我一向不太受得了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-secondBarbarianScene_DEMO-7677": "CORDELIA: 他总这样？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-secondBarbarianScene_DEMO-7678": "AGATA: 他，嗯……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-secondBarbarianScene_DEMO-7679": "AGATA: （你的……身体状况……最好还是别跟别人说。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-secondBarbarianScene_DEMO-7680": "BEN: 总算不用再说那种拉勒噜的语言，我可有一肚子话想讲。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-secondBarbarianScene_DEMO-7681": "AGATA: 他没事。走吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-thirdBarbarianScene_DEMO-7682": "AGATA: 我们在跟什么人战斗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-thirdBarbarianScene_DEMO-7683": "NIKOLAI: 嗯？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-thirdBarbarianScene_DEMO-7684": "NIKOLAI: 不就是……边地的野蛮人吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-thirdBarbarianScene_DEMO-7685": "JEROME: 我想她是说，他们的方言听着和她说的有些相似。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-thirdBarbarianScene_DEMO-7686": "AGATA: 你听得还真仔细。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-thirdBarbarianScene_DEMO-7687": "AGATA: 难道有些部落，在那时被困在了另一边——",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-thirdBarbarianScene_DEMO-7688": "NIKOLAI: 刚才到底怎么了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-thirdBarbarianScene_DEMO-7689": "MAIMUN: 尼古拉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-thirdBarbarianScene_DEMO-7690": "NIKOLAI: 又是你？我睡着了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-thirdBarbarianScene_DEMO-7691": "MAIMUN: 齐卡隆旁边的书架上有一本非常重要的书，你必须带走。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-thirdBarbarianScene_DEMO-7692": "NIKOLAI: 让其他人回来！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-thirdBarbarianScene_DEMO-7693": "MAIMUN: 拿上那本书，快！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-thirdBarbarianScene_DEMO-7694": "NIKOLAI: 这本？我连自己的语言都读不利索，拿它干什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-thirdBarbarianScene_DEMO-7695": "MAIMUN: 很快就该用到它了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-thirdBarbarianScene_DEMO-7696": "NIKOLAI: 可是——",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-thirdBarbarianScene_DEMO-7697": "NIKOLAI: 这书是干什么的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-thirdBarbarianScene_DEMO-7698": "JEROME: 什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-thirdBarbarianScene_DEMO-7699": "NIKOLAI: 不……算了，没什么。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-apingorixScene_DEMO-7700": "APINGORIX: 总算出来了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-apingorixScene_DEMO-7701": "APINGORIX: 怎么回事？在下面成家了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-apingorixScene_DEMO-7702": "NIKOLAI: 为什么这么做？我们帮过你。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-apingorixScene_DEMO-7703": "APINGORIX: 那时咱们利益一致，可现在有人悬赏要你的脑袋，我只是在做生意。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-apingorixScene_DEMO-7704": "NIKOLAI: 这么快就掉头替军队办事了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-apingorixScene_DEMO-7705": "APINGORIX: 只要价钱合适。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-apingorixScene_DEMO-7706": "APINGORIX: 不知道各位是谁，也不在乎。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-apingorixScene_DEMO-7707": "APINGORIX: 不过，把普罗赫上士和那个小魔法造物交给我，你们就能继续去参加什么化装舞会了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-apingorixScene_DEMO-7708": "JEROME: 那是不可能的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-apingorixScene_DEMO-7709": "APINGORIX: 总没人肯听道理。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-apingorixScene_DEMO-7710": "APINGORIX: 留神背后，普罗赫，你们自己人出这么高的价，来找你的猎人可不会只有我。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-apingorixScene_DEMO-7711": "NIKOLAI: 对不住，连累各位了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-apingorixScene_DEMO-7712": "AGATA: 你知道他被悬赏了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-apingorixScene_DEMO-7713": "JEROME: 不知道，不过他之所以被悬赏，是因为做了值得敬佩的事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-apingorixScene_DEMO-7714": "NIKOLAI: 没想到他们追这么远也不肯放过我。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-apingorixScene_DEMO-7715": "BEN: 我不是多嘴啊……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-apingorixScene_DEMO-7716": "BEN: ……可敌人要是清楚知道我们在哪儿，还怎么偷偷接近他们？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-apingorixScene_DEMO-7717": "CORDELIA: 大法师给我们的地图上，东北方标着一处山口。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-apingorixScene_DEMO-7718": "CORDELIA: 看起来很窄，也更加偏僻，也许能在那里甩掉追兵。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-apingorixScene_DEMO-7719": "AGATA: 我们人少。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-apingorixScene_DEMO-7720": "AGATA: 最好的办法，是赶在他们判断出我们的目的之前，尽快抵达目标。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-apingorixScene_DEMO-7721": "NIKOLAI: 好吧，我们还有事要办。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-apingorixScene_DEMO-7722": "JUNA: 走吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-apingorixScene_DEMO-7723": "ALEXANDRA: 我想……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-apingorixScene_DEMO-7724": "ALEXANDRA: 也许从一开始就错了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-apingorixScene_DEMO-7725": "JUNA: 嘿，跟着我就好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-apingorixScene_DEMO-7726": "JUNA: 我们会想出办法的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-apingorixScene_DEMO-7727": "JUNA: 来吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-ethosPalimpsestScene_DEMO-7728": "CORDELIA: 它真的存在……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-ethosPalimpsestScene_DEMO-7729": "NIKOLAI: 老先生不是说过了吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-ethosPalimpsestScene_DEMO-7730": "JEROME: 当然，可亲眼见到，又是另一回事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-ethosPalimpsestScene_DEMO-7731": "CORDELIA: 这本书本身就是历史。传说，它是世上最古老的书，用十多种语言写成。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-ethosPalimpsestScene_DEMO-7732": "CORDELIA: 有时，一种语言甚至叠写在另一种之上……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-ethosPalimpsestScene_DEMO-7733": "CORDELIA: （其他人到之前，也许还有片刻工夫研究一下……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-pathosPassagewayScene_DEMO-7734": "BEN: 有些东西，不一样了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-pathosPassagewayScene_DEMO-7735": "AGATA: 有光。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-pathosPassagewayScene_DEMO-7736": "JUNA: 也没有烂叶子的味道。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-pathosPassagewayScene_DEMO-7737": "ALEXANDRA: 好像听见了什么……低语声？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-pathosPassagewayScene_DEMO-7738": "AGATA: 应该快到了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-ethosArrivalScene_DEMO-7739": "NIKOLAI: 好……等一下……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-ethosArrivalScene_DEMO-7740": "NIKOLAI: 手放到眼前都看不见。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-ethosArrivalScene_DEMO-7741": "NIKOLAI: 谁带打火机了？我的找不着。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-ethosArrivalScene_DEMO-7742": "CORDELIA: 不必。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-ethosArrivalScene_DEMO-7743": "NIKOLAI: 哇。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-ethosArrivalScene_DEMO-7744": "NIKOLAI: 这种事，你们随时都能做到？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-ethosArrivalScene_DEMO-7745": "CORDELIA: 你对魔法的理解，似乎相当狭隘。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-ethosArrivalScene_DEMO-7746": "JEROME: 科黛莉娅是说，在我们国家，人们会用魔法处理各种事务。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-ethosArrivalScene_DEMO-7747": "JEROME: 连孩子都会这种法术。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-ethosArrivalScene_DEMO-7748": "NIKOLAI: 在我家那边，没获许可就用魔法，可是会被枪毙的……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-ethosArrivalScene_DEMO-7749": "JEROME: 这地方的状况可不太好，是吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-ethosArrivalScene_DEMO-7750": "NIKOLAI: 是啊，里面比外面长得还茂盛，怎么回事？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-ethosArrivalScene_DEMO-7751": "CORDELIA: 是书。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-ethosArrivalScene_DEMO-7752": "CORDELIA: 我猜，最后留在这里的几位学者，在被迫撤离之前……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-ethosArrivalScene_DEMO-7753": "CORDELIA: ……曾施法保护这些书的纸张。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-ethosArrivalScene_DEMO-7754": "CORDELIA: 可那道法术分不清纸张和造纸的植物。两百年过去，就成了这样。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-ethosArrivalScene_DEMO-7755": "NIKOLAI: 所以……知道我们要找的是哪本书吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-ethosArrivalScene_DEMO-7756": "CORDELIA: 记载说，《重写之书》无法移动。因此整座修道院，都是围绕它的存放处修建的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-ethosArrivalScene_DEMO-7757": "CORDELIA: 我猜，它应当在最底层的房间。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-ethosArrivalScene_DEMO-7758": "JEROME: 那就只能继续往下了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-newScene_DEMO-7759": "NIKOLAI: 这也是书上魔法的一部分？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-newScene_DEMO-7760": "CORDELIA: 算是吧。我想，古人就是用这套东西管书的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-newScene_DEMO-7761": "CORDELIA: 古人给某些书划了界，不许来访的人把书带出去。我猜能带去哪儿，得看书属于哪种魔法元素。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-newScene_DEMO-7762": "NIKOLAI: 你们不能直接解开吗？你们的魔法，总比古人高明吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-newScene_DEMO-7763": "CORDELIA: 给我几天时间，再加些工具，当然能破除封印。可我们没有那么多时间。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-newScene_DEMO-7764": "NIKOLAI: 那就得想办法，钻钻这套规矩的空子了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-doorPuzzleBook_DEMO-7765": "BOOK: 我想，我已经破解魔法迷宫的规则。九间房呈方格排列，从左上角开始编号。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-doorPuzzleBook_DEMO-7766": "BOOK: 入口在第四间，出口在第六间。左门使编号倒退二，右门使编号前进三。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-annex1_text1_DEMO-7767": "BOOK: 对动物解剖与古代化石的研究，使我得出一个结论：野兽的自然秩序，在相对较近的历史时期遭到了破坏。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-annex1_text1_DEMO-7768": "BOOK: 漫长岁月中，陆地上的捕食者，无论数量还是种类，都相对有限。捕食者太多，只会带来激烈竞争。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-annex1_text1_DEMO-7769": "BOOK: 可突然间，各种气候下都出现了大量危险野兽，猎物的数量却没有相应增加。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-annex1_text1_DEMO-7770": "BOOK: 这便是会用魔法的“魔物”兴起之时。它们既捕食，也彼此争斗。是什么造成了这种反常现象？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-b5_text2_DEMO-7771": "BOOK: 这些报告表明，魔力整体上越来越充沛。我们知道，埃特伦学徒的训练极为严苛……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-b5_text2_DEMO-7772": "BOOK: ……训练可能长达二十年。可如今，一个魔法才学到第二年的孩子，引导魔力的效率，便能胜过埃特伦的大法师。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-b5_text2_DEMO-7773": "BOOK: 迄今，人们都用现代魔法在理论与应用上的革新，来解释这一差异。但这种说法，实在缺乏审慎的思考。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-b5_text2_DEMO-7774": "BOOK: 在我们这个时代，连魔力最弱的乡下工匠，都能施放让埃特伦人瞠目的法术。难道这仅靠教育水平提升，就能解释？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-annex2_text1_DEMO-7775": "BOOK: 从希纳尔覆灭，到埃特伦帝国重新发现魔法，我们所知的魔法沉寂了近两千年，这是无可争议的事实。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-annex2_text1_DEMO-7776": "BOOK: 对此，所有学者都无异议。至于大空白期发生过什么，则只有猜测。许多无法证实的故事声称……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-annex2_text1_DEMO-7777": "BOOK: ……伊纳人及其他游徙部族，靠近某些古代魔法遗物时，仍能引导少量魔力。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-annex2_text1_DEMO-7778": "BOOK: 这类遗物从未被发现。若真有便携的魔力源，它必是世间最珍贵的物品之一。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-ethosWereHere_DEMO-7779": "NIKOLAI: 这门不会也是魔法吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-ethosWereHere_DEMO-7780": "CORDELIA: 门看起来是实物。至于机关……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-ethosWereHere_DEMO-7781": "NIKOLAI: 嗯……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-ethosWereHere_DEMO-7782": "ZIKARON: ……其他人……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-ethosWereHere_DEMO-7783": "NIKOLAI: 哪儿？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-ethosWereHere_DEMO-7784": "AGATA: 有动静，可能是他们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-ethosWereHere_DEMO-7785": "ALEXANDRA: 我们能……要放他们过来吗？会发生什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-ethosWereHere_DEMO-7786": "AGATA: 更重要的是，怎么放他们过来？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-ethosWereHere_DEMO-7787": "BEN: 再提醒我，谁才是那个笨蛋？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-ethosWereHere_DEMO-7788": "NIKOLAI: 他们又消失了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-ethosWereHere_DEMO-7789": "CORDELIA: 能看见他们，说明我们已接近《重写之书》的魔法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-ethosWereHere_DEMO-7790": "NIKOLAI: 但愿吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-ethosWereHere_DEMO-7791": "按“{0}”切换两支队伍，协作解开谜题！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-pathosPalimpsestScene_DEMO-7792": "AGATA: 应该就是它了吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-pathosPalimpsestScene_DEMO-7793": "AGATA: 不知道其他人是不是也在这里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-bothPalimpsestScene_DEMO-7794": "NIKOLAI: 希望其他人别耽搁太久。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-bothPalimpsestScene_DEMO-7795": "ZIKARON: ……到达……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-bothPalimpsestScene_DEMO-7796": "NIKOLAI: 是他们吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-bothPalimpsestScene_DEMO-7797": "KERAUNOS: 好，你们都到了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-bothPalimpsestScene_DEMO-7798": "KERAUNOS: 距我上次来这里，已经一百多年了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-bothPalimpsestScene_DEMO-7799": "KERAUNOS: 当时，我想弄清世界发生了什么……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-bothPalimpsestScene_DEMO-7800": "KERAUNOS: ……却只找到几页潦草的笔记，是变故后被困于此的学者留下的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-bothPalimpsestScene_DEMO-7801": "KERAUNOS: 不过，眼前的麻烦已经够多了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-bothPalimpsestScene_DEMO-7802": "KERAUNOS: 只要大家都站在《重写之书》附近，我就能准确判断你们的位置，让你们穿过去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-bothPalimpsestScene_DEMO-7803": "KERAUNOS: 会合之后，必须找出并铲除那些飞空艇的源头，不能再让它们残害更多人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-bothPalimpsestScene_DEMO-7804": "AGATA: 您不跟我们一起走？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-bothPalimpsestScene_DEMO-7805": "KERAUNOS: 我必须充当法术的锚点，所以不能沿着它的路径移动。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-bothPalimpsestScene_DEMO-7806": "KERAUNOS: 而且还有别的风险。指挥那些飞空艇的人，很可能也在寻找我，就像我在寻找他。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-bothPalimpsestScene_DEMO-7807": "ALEXANDRA: （等等，我们会不会被困在……那边？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-bothPalimpsestScene_DEMO-7808": "JUNA: （这话应该问他，不是问我。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-bothPalimpsestScene_DEMO-7809": "KERAUNOS: 准备好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-bothPalimpsestScene_DEMO-7810": "BEN: 我们……现在算到那边了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-bothPalimpsestScene_DEMO-7811": "JEROME: 确实到了。只是眼下，恐怕顾不上好好欢迎各位。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-bothPalimpsestScene_DEMO-7812": "BEN: 等等，你听得懂我！？我也听懂你了……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-bothPalimpsestScene_DEMO-7813": "NIKOLAI: 对，齐卡隆的魔法能让大家听懂彼此。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-bothPalimpsestScene_DEMO-7814": "BEN: 老天，多谢了。说他们的语言，简直像嘴里塞着葡萄讲话。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-bothPalimpsestScene_DEMO-7815": "CORDELIA: 互相介绍，还是留到以后吧。时间不等人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-bothPalimpsestScene_DEMO-7816": "JEROME: 说起来……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-bothPalimpsestScene_DEMO-7817": "JEROME: 有他们的魔法，应该能走西南边的楼梯出去，不必再沿绳子爬上去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-bothPalimpsestScene_DEMO-7818": "AGATA: 我们准备好了，随时可以走。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-noExitPathos_DEMO-7819": "AGATA: 刚到这里，现在不能走。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-noExitEthos_DEMO-7820": "NIKOLAI: 这里还有事要办。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-demoBoss_DEMO-7821": "谁敢挑战强大的博比！？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-palimpsest_text_DEMO-7822": "这本书上的文字无法抹去。数千年来，不断有人添写，却连一笔一画也未曾褪色。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/ethosArchives/ethosScenes_DEMO.yarn-didThisAlready_DEMO-7823": "NIKOLAI: 出口不是这扇门。得走右边的主楼梯。"
}
